"P3784215149" "Darque's assistant told you that Dr. Aeon, one of the other scientists working for Lord Recluse, personally came into the lab a short while ago and took Olivia while leaving these robot monstrosities behind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2044243921" "Here's a task simple enough even you can't screw it up. Olivia Darque, the Governor of Aeon City, is overdue on several reports that I need from her. I want you to play courier. Go to Aeon City in Cap au Diable, there you will find her offices. She should have the reports to hand over, and at best a flimsy excuse as to why they were not delivered on-time. Once you have the reports and an excuse from Olivia herself, return them to me and we can check that off your To Do list."
// AcceptString :
"P2180866770" "Get Reports from Aeon City"
// SendOffString :
"P2394604963" "Don't delay. I've been waiting for these reports long enough, I shouldn't have to wait any longer."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1007314708" "Get Reports for Mr. Pither"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3023742169" "Nothing makes me more irritated then an employee who has to be told twice what to do: Go to Aeon City, go into Olivia Darque's lab there and get me those overdue reports!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1597342771" "This is the right address, but no one is here to greet you. You'd better just get those reports and get back."

