// IntroString :
"P3588563161" "I've called in a couple favors and I have tasked you to get back Olivia Darque. You're going to have to go to the Shadow Shard itself and find her. This will bring her back to this plane of existence. It won't be easy, and I'm afraid we won't be able to recall you normally. But don't screw this up or this will put a black mark on all our records."
// SendOffString :
"P4258353626" "We believe that she's in a location called the 'Chantry'. It's supposed to house some kind of god, but he has shown no hostility, and apparently enjoys taking in strays. Once you've found Darque, you'll have to make it back to the portal yourself. I'm afraid I can't authorize the energy expenditure to transit you back. I'm sure you'll be able to make it out all right."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P472410736" "Find Olivia Darque & escape"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P687308464" "I don't like repeating myself when there is a time crunch: Go to the Shadow Shard, find Olivia Darque, and return."

